Ke hana nei ʻo 43rd Street Creative no BESV, kahi ʻike mele ʻoiaʻiʻo maoli, i nā kiʻi o nā makahiki āpau, nā kāne a me nā lāhui. ʻAʻole pono ka ʻike hana ma mua. E mālama ʻia nā loiloi virtual ma Iulai 3 a e wehe ʻia ka hōʻike i ke kauwela o 2021 ma BESV 567 Union ma lalo o ka protocol Covid i ʻae ʻia e ke Aupuni ʻo San Gabriel City.
ʻO Dream Catcher kahi wikiō mele VR kumu, i hana wale ʻia no BESv567 Arts Space me ka hui pū ʻana me ka International Association of Virtual and Extended Reality Artists and Media Producers. Ma kēia hui pū ʻana, ua hana mākou i ke kiʻi 3D kiʻekiʻe a me ka hopu ʻana e hoʻopuka i kahi ʻike wikiō wikiō leovisual piha piha me ka mana e hopu a hoʻokipa i nā mea hoʻolohe mai ka poʻe ʻōpio a hiki i ka poʻe kahiko loa a puni ka honua.
ʻO kēia ʻano hou i ke mele a me ka leʻaleʻa e hiki ai i kēlā me kēia mea nānā a me ka mea kūʻai aku o kēia ʻano hōʻike ke loaʻa kahi pilina pilikino pilikino a hana a kaʻana like me ke kaiāulu holoʻokoʻa. E like me ka media kahiko;

